# Z7 Clothes Factory — Environment Variables

# =============================================
# SUPABASE (Backend / Database / Auth)
# =============================================
# Get these from: https://supabase.com -> Project -> Settings -> API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# =============================================
# NOTES
# =============================================
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your actual values.
# 2. Never commit .env.local or any file containing real credentials.
# 3. All Vite env vars must be prefixed with VITE_ to be accessible in the browser.
# 4. The app will work without these set — it will use localStorage-based
#    persistence and mock authentication until Supabase is configured.
